{
  "name": "Blade of Disaster",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> A blade-shaped planar rift appears within 60 ft while you concentrate (up to 1 minute). When you cast it, make up to two melee spell attacks against creatures or objects within 5 ft of the rift: 10d6 Force damage each, a Critical Hit on a d20 of 18 or higher. As a Bonus Action on later turns, move the rift up to 60 ft and make the two attacks again (Rift Attack activity). It passes harmlessly through any barrier.</p>",
